Package: kde-cli-tools
Version: @DEB_KDECLITOOLS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kde-cli-tools
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-svg, kf6-config, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-iconthemes, kf6-kcmutils, kf6-kio, kf6-parts, kf6-service, kf6-windowsystem, shared-mime-info
Description: KDE command-line and helper tools for Xios
 Small Plasma tools used by the desktop shell and System Settings: the File
 Associations module (kcm_filetypes) and its standalone editor, the
 systemsettings:// URL handler plasma-open-settings, the KIO command-line
 clients (kioclient6, kde-open, kdecp, kdemv), kde-inhibit,
 kbroadcastnotification, kstart, kmimetypefinder and ksvgtopng.
 Note: kcmshell6 is not part of this package; it ships in kf6-kcmutils.
